error[RB0403]: `id` might not be assigned yet when this is evaluated
  --> RB0403-machine-transition.road:11:15
   |
11 |   exit do log(id)
   |               ^^
...
14 |   initial Idle
   |           ---- `Body.Idle` is entered when `Body` starts, and nothing before it assigns `id`
   |
   = help: `exit` can run as soon as `Body` is entered (a transition out, or cancelling the run), so assign `id` on every way into `Body`, give it an initial value, or make its type optional

